GeneralsX: AMD FidelityFX FSR 2 temporal upscaler in the swap chain blitter.
DXVK_UPSCALER=fsr2 upscales the 3D scene with FSR 2 (v2.2.1, MIT) and
composites the FSR 1.0 EASU image wherever the interface was drawn.
The FidelityFX sources are copied to src/dxvk/fsr2/ffx-fsr2-api by the
build; without them DXVK builds as before and FSR 2 reports unavailable.

